        "original_id": "5170bc2d-21d0-5fa9-8c8f-a354f6aa4a07",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Connie Ray, Kirsten Olson, Tim Fywell, Hadley Davis, Meg Cabot, Michelle Trachtenberg, Joan Cusack, Kim Cattrall, Hayden Panettiere\n- Works: Ice Princess, Thank You for Smoking, Stuart Little, ER, George Lopez\n- Roles: Nikki Fletcher, \"Jumping Shrimp\"\n\nFacts:\n- Connie Ray was born on July 10, 1956, and she is an American film and television actress and playwright.\n- Connie Ray appeared in the television drama \"ER\" in 1997.\n- Connie Ray appeared in the film \"Stuart Little\" in 1999.\n- Connie Ray appeared on \"George Lopez\" in 2002.\n- \"Ice Princess\" is a 2005 American figure-skating film directed by Tim Fywell and written by Hadley Davis from a story by Meg Cabot and Hadley Davis.\n- \"Ice Princess\" stars Michelle Trachtenberg, Joan Cusack, Kim Cattrall, and Hayden Panettiere.\n- Kirsten Olson played Nikki Fletcher, the \"Jumping Shrimp,\" in the Disney film \"Ice Princess\" in 2005.\n- Connie Ray appeared in \"Ice Princess\" in 2005.\n- Connie Ray appeared in \"Thank You for Smoking\" in 2006.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
